-1
->>> nC('abc', 2)
-3
->>> nC(3, 2)
-3
@@ -163,2 +52,0 @@ Calculate the number of permutations of length ``k``.
-nT
---
@@ -166 +53,0 @@ nT
-Calculate the number of partitions that have ``k`` parts.
@@ -168,8 +54,0 @@ Calculate the number of partitions that have ``k`` parts.
->>> [nT(items, k) for k in range(len(items) + 1)], nT(items)
-([0, 1, 5, 4, 1], 11)
->>> nT('aaa', 2)
-1
