-27. .. math:: p = q + 1 \wedge s = 0 \wedge \phi = 0 \wedge 0 < t \wedge 0 < b^{*} \wedge 0 \leq c^{*} \wedge \pi c^{*} < \lvert{\operatorname{arg}\left(\omega\right)}\rvert \wedge C_{1} \wedge C_{3} \wedge C_{10} \wedge C_{14} \wedge C_{15}
