-<http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gamma_function>`_, ``gamma``.  ``gamma(z)``
-represents `\Gamma(z) = \int_0^\infty t^{z - 1}e^{-t}\,dt`, which for positive integer
-`z` is the same as `(z - 1)!`.
