-    in the Risch integration algorithm, where we must write exp(x) + exp(x/2)
-    as (exp(x/2))**2 + exp(x/2), but not as exp(x) + sqrt(exp(x)) (this is
-    because only the transcendental case is implemented and we therefore cannot
