-#   roles: G(1/z) has slightly altered parameters, with ap and bq interchanged.
-#
-# o There are four shift operators:
-#   A_J = b_J - D,     J = 1, ..., n
-#   B_J = 1 - a_j + D, J = 1, ..., m
-#   C_J = -b_J + D,    J = m+1, ..., q
-#   D_J = a_J - 1 - D, J = n+1, ..., p
